proper administration, documentation, reporting, and delivery of various education courses and training programs."}],"$L1b"]]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"],"$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]}]]}],"$L21","$L22"]
1b:["$","p","At CITIS InfoTech, we facilitate a centrally-managed, customized LMS that focuses on achieving academic excellence through comprehensive management of various education courses and training and development programs. We nurture of team of LMS developers that understand your needs and develop a specific LMS solution that helps you create an edge over your competitors.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"At CITIS InfoTech, we facilitate a centrally-managed, customized LMS that focuses on achieving academic excellence through comprehensive management of various education courses and training and development programs. We nurture of team of LMS developers that understand your needs and develop a specific LMS solution that helps you create an edge over your competitors."}]
1c:["$","section","Our LMS Features and Functionalities",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Our LMS Features and Functionalities"}],[["$","p","Right from adding new courses, updating existing ones to adding, modifying assessments, and supporting learning through various content forms, our LMS does everything necessary to help you manage your courses appropriately and keep track of each one of it through a central system that provides real-time insights. Take a look at what you get through our end-to-end and customized LMS solution.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Right from adding new courses, updating existing ones to adding, modifying assessments, and supporting learning through various content forms, our LMS does everything necessary to help you manage your courses appropriately and keep track of each one of it through a central system that provides real-time insights. Take a look at what you get through our end-to-end and customized LMS solution."}],["$","p","User Settings and Access Control: You can add, delete, update users, see the list of users, and create various access levels to ensure IT security.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"User Settings and Access Control: You can add, delete, update users, see the list of users, and create various access levels to ensure IT security."}],["$","p","Course Management: The course management section enables you to manage courses, add course categories, add new courses, restore a course, upload courses, etc. The system also allows you to add topics to the course and do activities such as create assignments for a particular topic, add glossary, etc.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Course Management: The course management section enables you to manage courses, add course categories, add new courses, restore a course, upload courses, etc. The system also allows you to add topics to the course and do activities such as create assignments for a particular topic, add glossary, etc."}],["$","p","Grade Management: You can also store, track and monitor the grades of every student through the grade management section. It helps you compute the progress of the student and thus pave the way for personalized feedback to the student and his or her parents.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Grade Management: You can also store, track and monitor the grades of every student through the grade management section. It helps you compute the progress of the student and thus pave the way for personalized feedback to the student and his or her parents."}],["$","p","Reports: Through the report tab, you can generate a range of comprehensive reports comprising real-time data to help you get the necessary insights and make information-based decisions.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Reports: Through the report tab, you can generate a range of comprehensive reports comprising real-time data to help you get the necessary insights and make information-based decisions."}],["$","p","Assessment Management: You can add various types of assessments such as multiple-choice, true/false, matching, short answers, essay type, numerical, embedded answers, drag and drop into text, etc. Additionally, you can add details about the assessment, such as its timings, layout, grades, appearance, extra restrictions on attempts, etc., to let teachers have a proper understanding of it.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Assessment Management: You can add various types of assessments such as multiple-choice, true/false, matching, short answers, essay type, numerical, embedded answers, drag and drop into text, etc. Additionally, you can add details about the assessment, such as its timings, layout, grades, appearance, extra restrictions on attempts, etc., to let teachers have a proper understanding of it."}]]]}]
1d:["$","section","Why Choose CITIS InfoTech for LMS?",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Why Choose CITIS InfoTech for LMS?"}],[["$","p","Here are a few reasons that make us the leading LMS provider in Pune.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Here are a few reasons that make us the leading LMS provider in Pune."}]]]}]
1e:["$","section","Prompt technical support for optimized operational efficiency at all times",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-heading text-2xl font-semibold sm:text-3xl","children":"Prompt technical support for optimized operational efficiency at all times"}],[["$","p","LMS, considering the competencies that it brings to the table, is the need of the hour. So, why stick to conventional learning management when you can modernize it and turn it more efficient? Connect with CITIS InfoTech at +91 20 2567 70 60 or write to support@citis.in, and our LMS experts would be glad to assist you.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"LMS, considering the competencies that it brings to the table, is the need of the hour. So, why stick to conventional learning management when you can modernize it and turn it more efficient? Connect with CITIS InfoTech at +91 20 2567 70 60 or write to support@citis.in, and our LMS experts would be glad to assist you."}]]]}]
1f:["$","aside",null,{"className":"mt-12 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-accent bg-primary/5 p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-heading text-xl font-semibold","children":"The practical takeaway"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-muted-foreground","children":"Start with one meaningful learner outcome, create an authentic way to observe it, and support educators to improve the experience together."}]]}]
